{"seq":1,"slug":"aml-stored-value","title":"反洗钱：充值限额/可疑交易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/aml-fraud/aml-stored-value","wordCount":2151,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"反洗钱-充值限额-可疑交易\">反洗钱：充值限额/可疑交易</h1><p>储值工具对洗钱者有独特的吸引力：它把「现金」转换成了一种<strong>看起来干净、可远程转移、能在受监管渠道之外流动</strong>的价值。一张礼品卡可以在几分钟内买下、转移给别人、再换成商品或折价套现，全程不需要开银行账户，不需要解释资金来源。本文讲这条链路在工程上应该怎么设防——重点不是给出一套阈值，而是给出<strong>限额模型与监测所需的数据结构</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-储值洗钱的三段链路\">核心概念：储值洗钱的三段链路</h2><p>洗钱通常分三段：<strong>放置（placement，把非法资金注入金融体系）、分层（layering，通过多层交易掩盖来源）、整合（integration，变成可自由使用的资产）</strong>。礼品卡在每一段都有对应形态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>礼品卡形态</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n<th>防御落点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>放置</td>\n<td>用现金购买大量高面值卡</td>\n<td>线下批量买卡、单笔接近但低于申报门槛</td>\n<td>充值侧限额、单笔与累计口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层</td>\n<td>卡在多个账户间流转、余额转账、跨币种兑换</td>\n<td>高频转赠、环形流转、账户归集</td>\n<td>转账/兑换的限额与模式监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整合</td>\n<td>折价转卖卡密、用余额买高流通性商品再转卖</td>\n<td>二级市场套现、买电子产品/虚拟商品</td>\n<td>卡密兑换监测、商品侧联动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上有两个关键认识。<strong>其一，防御重心在放置段</strong>——一旦资金以储值形态进入系统，后续追溯成本陡增，因此充值侧的限额与身份核验是最有效的单点。<strong>其二，储值系统的监测优势在于流水完整</strong>：第 2 章的<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">只追加流水</a>本身就是最好的监测输入，这也是只追加模型在合规之外的第二重价值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[现金/盗刷资金] --&gt; B[购买礼品卡]&#10;    A --&gt; C[充值到账户]&#10;    B --&gt; D[卡密转移]&#10;    C --&gt; E[账户余额]&#10;    D --&gt; F[兑换入账]&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; G[转赠/账户间转账]&#10;    G --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; H[购买商品]&#10;    E --&gt; I[折价套现: 二级市场]&#10;    H --&gt; J[转卖商品变现]&#10;    K[限额层] -.约束.-&gt; B&#10;    K -.约束.-&gt; C&#10;    K -.约束.-&gt; G&#10;    K -.约束.-&gt; I&#10;    L[监测层] -.观察.-&gt; D&#10;    L -.观察.-&gt; G&#10;    L -.观察.-&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[现金/盗刷资金] --&gt; B[购买礼品卡]\n    A --&gt; C[充值到账户]\n    B --&gt; D[卡密转移]\n    C --&gt; E[账户余额]\n    D --&gt; F[兑换入账]\n    F --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; G[转赠/账户间转账]\n    G --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; H[购买商品]\n    E --&gt; I[折价套现: 二级市场]\n    H --&gt; J[转卖商品变现]\n    K[限额层] -.约束.-&gt; B\n    K -.约束.-&gt; C\n    K -.约束.-&gt; G\n    K -.约束.-&gt; I\n    L[监测层] -.观察.-&gt; D\n    L -.观察.-&gt; G\n    L -.观察.-&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"限额模型-至少四个维度\">限额模型：至少四个维度</h2><p>「每人每天充值不超过 X」是一条不合格的规则，因为它太容易被绕过。一个可用的限额模型至少要在四个维度上同时约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TopupLimits {&#10;  perTransaction: Money;&#10;  perDay: Money;&#10;  perMonth: Money;&#10;  perRollingWindow: { window_days: number; cap: Money };&#10;  perInstrument: { kind: &#39;card&#39; | &#39;wallet&#39; | &#39;bank&#39;; cap: Money };&#10;  velocity: { maxCount: number; window_hours: number };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TopupDecision {&#10;  verdict: &#39;ALLOW&#39; | &#39;REVIEW&#39; | &#39;BLOCK&#39;;&#10;  limitHit: keyof TopupLimits | null;&#10;  cumulative: { dayMinor: number; monthMinor: number; rollingMinor: number };&#10;  requiresVerification: VerificationLevel;&#10;  reason: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TopupLimits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perDay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perMonth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perRollingWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">window_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perInstrument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'card'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'wallet'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bank'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  velocity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">window_hours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TopupDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  verdict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ALLOW'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVIEW'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BLOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  limitHit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TopupLimits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cumulative</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dayMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">monthMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rollingMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requiresVerification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VerificationLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>单笔限额</strong>防的是大额一击，但它单独使用几乎无效——拆成十笔即可绕过。<strong>日/月累计</strong>是有效约束，但要注意<strong>时区与自然日边界</strong>：用户可以在日界线附近连续充值两天的额度，因此通常需要滚动窗口（<code>perRollingWindow</code>）补充。<strong>滚动窗口</strong>（如任意 7 天内不超过 X）能有效对抗跨日拆分，代价是查询成本更高（需要按时间范围聚合流水）。</p>\n<p><strong>分渠道限额</strong>（<code>perInstrument</code>）防的是「用同一张银行卡给多个账户充值」与「多个渠道绕过单一渠道限额」。<strong>速度限制</strong>（<code>velocity</code>）约束的是笔数而非金额——「两小时内充值 15 笔小额」本身就是可疑模式，即使总额不大。第 4 章第 2 篇会讲速度限制在盗刷场景的另一种用法。</p>\n<p><strong>限额必须按币种分别累计，或按记账币种折算并声明折算时点</strong>。第 2 章<a href=\"../stored-balance/multi-currency-balance\">多币种余额与礼品卡币种</a>已经警告过这一点：累计口径含糊会让同一用户在汇率波动时忽而触发限额。</p>\n<p><strong>限额不是全部答案，它还需要与身份核验分级联动</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type VerificationLevel = &#39;ANONYMOUS&#39; | &#39;CONTACT_VERIFIED&#39; | &#39;ID_VERIFIED&#39; | &#39;FULL_KYC&#39;;&#10;&#10;function limitFor(level: VerificationLevel, j: JurisdictionDecision): TopupLimits {&#10;  switch (level) {&#10;    case &#39;ANONYMOUS&#39;:&#10;      return j.anonymousLimits;&#10;    case &#39;CONTACT_VERIFIED&#39;:&#10;      return j.contactLimits;&#10;    case &#39;ID_VERIFIED&#39;:&#10;      return j.idLimits;&#10;    case &#39;FULL_KYC&#39;:&#10;      return j.fullLimits;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VerificationLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ANONYMOUS'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONTACT_VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ID_VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FULL_KYC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> limitFor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VerificationLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JurisdictionDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TopupLimits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (level) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ANONYMOUS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j.anonymousLimits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONTACT_VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j.contactLimits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ID_VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j.idLimits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FULL_KYC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j.fullLimits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>匿名层必须存在且有明确上限</strong>，而不是「不允许匿名」。原因是线下现金买卡本来就无法核验身份，如果产品上允许这种卡，系统就必须给它一个受限的可用范围——典型做法是限制它的转让能力与折现能力，而不是禁止购买。这个设计选择本身是<strong>产品的合规姿态</strong>，技术要做的是把级别与限额做成配置而不是硬编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可疑交易模式-五类可计算信号\">可疑交易模式：五类可计算信号</h2><p>监测规则的价值在于可计算。以下五类信号可以用流水直接算出，是本 hub 建议的最小集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type SuspicionSignal =&#10;  | { kind: &#39;STRUCTURING&#39;; windowHours: number; count: number; belowThresholdRatio: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;RAPID_IN_OUT&#39;; maxHoldMinutes: number; minAmountMinor: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;FAN_OUT&#39;; windowHours: number; distinctRecipients: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;FAN_IN&#39;; windowHours: number; distinctSenders: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;CYCLE&#39;; maxPathLength: number; amountToleranceBps: number };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SuspicionSignal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'STRUCTURING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">belowThresholdRatio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RAPID_IN_OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxHoldMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minAmountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAN_OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">distinctRecipients</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAN_IN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">distinctSenders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CYCLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxPathLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amountToleranceBps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>结构化（structuring / smurfing）</strong> 是「多笔金额接近但低于申报门槛」的模式。可计算版本是：在 <code>windowHours</code> 内，充值笔数 ≥ <code>count</code>，且其中 ≥ <code>belowThresholdRatio</code> 比例的金额落在门槛的某个下沿区间（如门槛的 85%–99.9%）。这个信号需要同时看笔数与金额分布，只看其中一个都会误报。</p>\n<p><strong>快速进出（rapid in-out）</strong> 是「充值后极短时间内在另一处取出/消费」。储值场景的对应形态是：充值后 <code>maxHoldMinutes</code> 内通过转赠或折价套现流出。因为储值系统的流出通常是购物而非提现，这个信号要结合商品侧（高流通性商品、虚拟商品、易转卖商品）一起看。</p>\n<p><strong>扇出（fan-out）与扇入（fan-in）</strong> 是分层阶段的典型结构：一个账户在短时间内向多个不同接收方转赠，或多个账户向同一账户归集。这两类信号用第 1 章<a href=\"../gift-card-lifecycle/card-transfer-gift\">礼品卡转赠与受赠</a>的 <code>giftTransfer</code> 表与余额流水的 <code>ACCOUNT_TRANSFER</code> 来源可以直接聚合。<strong>归集是转卖卡密的前置动作</strong>，所以扇入信号在礼品卡场景中权重应高于普通支付场景。</p>\n<p><strong>环形流转（cycle）</strong> 是 A→B→C→A 这类闭环，目的是制造交易假象。可计算版本是在转赠图上找长度 ≤ <code>maxPathLength</code> 的环，且环上各边金额接近（<code>amountToleranceBps</code> 内）。注意<strong>正常的社交转赠也可能形成短环</strong>（A 送 B、B 回赠 A），因此这个信号必须结合时间窗口与金额特征，不能单独作为拦截依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SuspicionHit {&#10;  signal: SuspicionSignal[&#39;kind&#39;];&#10;  accountIds: string[];&#10;  entryIds: string[];&#10;  windowFrom: Date;&#10;  windowTo: Date;&#10;  score: number;&#10;  evidence: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SuspicionHit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  signal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SuspicionSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kind'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  accountIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entryIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  windowFrom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  windowTo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entryIds</code> 与 <code>evidence</code> 是必填的：<strong>任何命中都必须能指向具体流水</strong>，否则复核人员无法判断，也无法形成报送材料。这与第 3 章对账报告的 <code>sampleEntryIds</code> 是同一条原则——<strong>可追溯性是这类系统的核心质量，而不是附赠品</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内部人员与人工调整\">内部人员与人工调整</h2><p>第 2 章<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">余额账户与只追加流水</a>已经指出人工调整是最高危的动作。在反洗钱语境下它还要再加一层：<strong>内部人员合谋是储值业务中最难发现的一类舞弊</strong>，因为操作者拥有合法权限，日志看起来完全正常。</p>\n<p>防线有三条，都是工程手段而非制度手段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>人工调整必须全部进监测范围</strong>，且额度有硬上限，超限需双人复核（系统层面强制，不是流程约定）。</li>\n<li><strong>调整的对象要与操作者分离审计</strong>：定期检查「同一操作者反复向同一批账户调整」的模式，这是合谋的可计算特征。</li>\n<li><strong>调整必须带工单号</strong>（<code>ticketId</code>），工单号对应外部系统的真实记录，使得「编造理由」需要同时伪造两个系统的记录。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>监测系统自己的告警也要被监测</strong>：如果某个规则的触发量突然归零，可能是规则被误改或被绕过；如果某个账户反复触发但不被处理，说明复核流程失效。这两条都属于运营监控，本文只点出它们必须存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>储值洗钱按放置/分层/整合三段展开</strong>，防御重心在放置段（充值侧限额与身份核验）——资金一旦以储值形态进入系统，追溯成本陡增。</li>\n<li><strong>只追加流水本身就是最好的监测输入</strong>，这是它在合规之外的第三重价值（前两重是正确性与可审计）。</li>\n<li><strong>限额至少四维</strong>（单笔/日/月/滚动窗口 + 分渠道 + 速度），单笔限额单独使用几乎无效；累计口径必须明确币种与折算时点。</li>\n<li><strong>限额与身份核验分级联动</strong>，匿名层应存在但有明确上限——禁止匿名在现金购卡场景下不可行，正确做法是限制其转让与折现能力。</li>\n<li><strong>五类可计算信号</strong>：结构化、快速进出、扇出、扇入、环形流转；每类都需要窗口 + 金额分布两个维度，单看一个会误报。</li>\n<li><strong>任何命中必须带 <code>entryIds</code> 与 <code>evidence</code></strong>，可追溯性是核心质量而非附赠品。</li>\n<li><strong>人工调整是内部合谋的高危面</strong>：全量纳入监测、硬额度上限、双人复核由系统强制、工单号跨系统可核。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>监测之外还有一道更硬的防线在代码层：卡密怎么存、兑换怎么保证只成功一次，见<a href=\"card-security-codes\">卡密安全与兑换幂等</a>；而攻击者如何用盗刷资金买卡，见<a href=\"gift-card-fraud\">盗刷买卡/卡密欺诈防护</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反洗钱：充值限额/可疑交易","id":"反洗钱-充值限额-可疑交易"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：储值洗钱的三段链路","id":"核心概念-储值洗钱的三段链路"},{"level":2,"text":"限额模型：至少四个维度","id":"限额模型-至少四个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"可疑交易模式：五类可计算信号","id":"可疑交易模式-五类可计算信号"},{"level":2,"text":"内部人员与人工调整","id":"内部人员与人工调整"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"储值负债对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/expiry-residual/balance-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"盗刷买卡/卡密欺诈防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/aml-fraud/gift-card-fraud"}}